1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,124
O‘yin kuni!

2
00:00:01,144 --> 00:00:02,734
Zamin FK — Star Boys.

3
00:00:02,754 --> 00:00:05,878
Yangi stadionimizda birinchi katta sinov!

4
00:00:05,898 --> 00:00:07,642
O‘n sakkizinchi daqiqa…

5
00:00:07,662 --> 00:00:08,659
qarshi hujum!

6
00:00:15,359 --> 00:00:15,766
Gol!

7
00:00:15,786 --> 00:00:16,513
Mahmud!

8
00:00:16,533 --> 00:00:17,599
Nol — bir.

9
00:00:17,909 --> 00:00:19,521
Rustam aka jahlda…

10
00:00:19,541 --> 00:00:21,989
Ammo Zamin FK javob beradi!

11
00:00:27,639 --> 00:00:28,336
Gooool!

12
00:00:28,356 --> 00:00:29,155
Jovohir!

13
00:00:29,175 --> 00:00:30,199
Bir — bir!

14
00:00:30,989 --> 00:00:31,759
Tanaffus.

15
00:00:31,779 --> 00:00:32,725
Hisob teng.

16
00:00:32,745 --> 00:00:34,394
Echki esa xotirjam.

17
00:00:34,414 --> 00:00:38,189
Ikkinchi bo‘lim — oltmish yettinchi daqiqa…

18
00:00:43,539 --> 00:00:44,229
Bekzod…

19
00:00:44,249 --> 00:00:45,039
uzoqdan!

20
00:00:45,059 --> 00:00:45,445
Gol.

21
00:00:45,465 --> 00:00:46,579
Bir — ikki.

22
00:00:46,889 --> 00:00:48,097
Yana ortdamiz.

23
00:00:48,117 --> 00:00:50,902
Lekin Zamin FK taslim bo‘lmaydi!

24
00:00:50,922 --> 00:00:53,289
Sakson to‘qqizinchi daqiqa…

25
00:00:58,059 --> 00:00:59,091
Abdullayev!

26
00:00:59,111 --> 00:01:00,143
Bosh bilan!

27
00:01:00,163 --> 00:01:00,812
Gooool!

28
00:01:00,832 --> 00:01:01,979
Ikki — ikki!

29
00:01:03,189 --> 00:01:05,528
Yakuniy hisob: ikki — ikki.

30
00:01:05,548 --> 00:01:06,664
Xarakter bor!

31
00:01:06,684 --> 00:01:09,829
Ammo klub egasi katta qarorga keldi…

32
00:01:10,629 --> 00:01:13,315
Zamin FK’ga yangi menejer kerak!

33
00:01:13,335 --> 00:01:15,853
Jamoani siz boshqara olasizmi?

34
00:01:15,873 --> 00:01:19,320
Izohlarda yozing: «Men menejer bo‘laman!»

35
00:01:19,340 --> 00:01:22,469
Balki keyingi menejer — aynan sizsiz!

